{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/490321-gift-of-knowledge-the-story-is-true-p128-2ed","id":490321,"title":"Gift of Knowledge: The Story is True (P128 2ed)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-24T01:35:28-07:00","id":490321,"title":"Gift of Knowledge: The Story is True (P128 2ed)","content":"I have a brief rules question on Gift of Knowledge: The Story is True (Glory) from P128 of Werewolf the Forsaken 2ed.<br /> <br /> A successful use results in the target (yourself or other) gaining temporary dots in any skill of two or fewer dots.<br /> <br /> Firstly <b><i>&quot;the Facet grants a number of dots equal to the successes rolled&quot;</i></b>. Does this mean your skill becomes equal the successes rolled, or they are added on? I suspect its the latter, but as it says 'grants' rather 'grants additional' or 'adds', it could be the former.<br /> <br /> Secondly <b><i>&quot;The Uratha may not use the Facet on more than one target at a time&quot;. </i></b>This line implies to me that multiple uses of the power can be in effect on one individual, as there is one target of the power (even though the power has been used multiple times). While it reads as though multiple uses on one target are possible, I can appreciate that this may not be the spirit of the power, as it could be potentially very strong in multiple uses. That said, 2 essence is a steep cost, so this could considered a restricting factor so it doesn't get out of hand.<br /> <br /> Thanks for your help on this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5777-bazkahuna","name":"Bazkahuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5777_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T02:33:24-07:00","id":490354,"title":"","content":"1) Success add dots, to a max skill of 5. <br /> <br /> 2) 'Target' refers to individual and skill. Using the Facet on a different target, or applying again to the same target, cancels the previous use and replaces it with the new use.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T02:39:15-07:00","id":490359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/490321-gift-of-knowledge-the-story-is-true-p128-2ed?p=490354#post490354\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) Success add dots, to a max skill of 5.<br /> <br /> 2) 'Target' refers to individual and skill. Using the Facet on a different target, or applying again to the same target, cancels the previous use and replaces it with the new use.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wonderful, and thank you for the quick response. I thought the former was the case due to how mechanics usually work and the latter I suspected but wasn't too sure.<br /> <br /> Thanks again!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5777-bazkahuna","name":"Bazkahuna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5777_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}